+
+## Widget visibility
+
+Set `widget.enabled` to `false` to hide the persistent todo widget. The `todo`
+tool and `/todos` command remain available. The default is `true`.
+
+```json
+{ "widget": { "enabled": false } }
+```
+
+The widget reads this option on each update, so changing the configuration does
+not require `/reload`.
